1
00:00:00,800 --> 00:00:05,860
Slide 25 diagrams "GOOGLE WORKSPACE INTEGRATION."

2
00:00:06,560 --> 00:00:14,216
Look at the automated workflow flow: An incoming email arrives in Gmail, triggering a lightweight Google Apps Script webhook.

3
00:00:14,216 --> 00:00:24,630
The script passes the email body to Gemini Flash for categorization and draft synthesis, then automatically archives the email and appends a summary row to Google Sheets.

4
00:00:25,330 --> 00:00:32,224
Notice that this entire workflow runs serverlessly inside Google's enterprise cloud infrastructure.

5
00:00:32,224 --> 00:00:38,840
You do not need to manage expensive dedicated servers or configure complex Kubernetes clusters.

6
00:00:39,540 --> 00:00:44,960
It transforms standard office tools into an autonomous, intelligent operations hub!

